{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21962","headline":"采地黄者 · 白居易","name":"采地黄者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麦死春不雨，禾损秋早霜。\n岁晏无口食，田中采地黄。\n采时将何用，持以易餱粮。\n凌晨荷锄去，薄暮不盈筐。\n携来朱门家，卖与白面郎。\n与君噉肥马，可使照地光。\n愿易马残粟，救此苦饥肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}